重击该目标，对其造成400% + 50% ATK伤害并使目标“暴露要害”。“暴露要害”的目标所受的物理伤害提升40%。当克鲁格对“暴露要害”的目标造成伤害时恢复相当于伤害量40%的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","近くに「破甲」が4スタック以上付与されており、「急所露呈」状態ではない敵がいる場合、その対象に重撃を放って400% + 50% ATKのダメージを与え、「急所露呈」を付与。「急所露呈」状態の敵は被物理ダメージ+40%。クルーガーが「急所露呈」状態の敵にダメージを与えた時、自身のHPをダメージ量×40%分回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが440% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが480% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが520% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身远程防御。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の遠距離防御UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の遠距離防御+16"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の遠距離防御+21"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升26点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の遠距離防御+26"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","孤胆独行"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","孤軍奮闘"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若附近没有友军，则获得护盾。战斗中，若附近没有友军，则提升生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、周囲に味方がいない場合、シールドを獲得。戦闘中、周囲に味方がいない場合、ライフスティールUP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，如果周围1格内没有友军，则获得可抵御40% HP伤害的护盾，持续15秒，护盾存在期间免控。战斗中，如果周围1格内没有友军，克鲁格增加30点生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、周囲1マス内に味方がいない場合、40% HP分のシールドを15秒間獲得。シールドの存在期間中、行動阻害無効になる。戦闘中、周囲1マス内に味方がいない場合、自身のライフスティール+30"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至44% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","シールド値が44% HPにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“要害打击”不再有距离限制（其他限制不变），克鲁格可以冲向符合条件敌人，并释放“要害打击”。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「急所攻撃」は距離制限の影響を受けない（他の制限は有効）。クルーガーは条件を満たした対象に突進して「急所攻撃」を発動できるようになる"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至48% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","シールド値が48% HPにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“暴露要害”的敌人被击败时，克鲁格攻击力永久提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「急所露呈」状態になった敵が撃破された時、永続的に自身の攻撃力UP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当技能“要害打击”造成“暴露要害”的敌人被击败时，克鲁格攻击力提升40%，该效果最多可叠加2次，直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「急所攻撃」で「急所露呈」状態になった敵が撃破された時、永続的に自身の攻撃力+40%、最大2回まで重複可能"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蛮石战斧"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","岩石の戦斧"]]}